# Genspark Help Center

> Guides and answers for every Genspark feature, from Super Agent and AI Slides to membership plans, credits, and account help.

Official Genspark Help Center documentation. Every article below is a server-rendered HTML page under https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter — the full text is in the initial response, no JavaScript required. Each article is also served in 18 other languages at https://www.genspark.ai/{locale}/helpcenter/{slug} (for example https://www.genspark.ai/ja/helpcenter/credits-guide). The Markdown of every article is also available as one file at https://www.genspark.ai/llms-full.txt.

## Products

- [GenTeam](https://www.genspark.ai/genteam): AI team workspace where AI agents and people work together in shared channels — hire AI teammates with real roles and get back finished work. Server-rendered landing page, localized under /{locale}/genteam.
- [Claude Code on your phone with GenTeam](https://www.genspark.ai/cli-agents): run the Claude Code, Codex CLI, or Cursor CLI on your own computer as a GenTeam agent you can message from the iOS/Android app, with push notifications and cloud agents that keep working while your laptop sleeps. Server-rendered, localized under /{locale}/cli-agents.
- [Genspark for Business](https://www.genspark.ai/business/llms.txt): the all-in-one AI workspace for teams

## Product Features

- [Super Agent](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/super-agent): Learn how to use Genspark Super Agent to run almost any task from a single prompt, from research and content creation to data analysis and phone calls.
- [AI Slides](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/ai-slides): Learn how to create presentations with Genspark AI Slides. Research, generate, and design slides from simple prompts, then export to PDF, PPTX, or Google Slides.
- [AI Sheets](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/ai-sheets): Learn how to use Genspark AI Sheets to collect, analyze, and visualize spreadsheet data through conversation, with full Excel (.xlsx) import and export.
- [AI Docs](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/ai-docs): Learn how to create and edit documents with Genspark AI Docs. Work in Rich Text or Markdown, then export to HTML, Word, or PDF.
- [Genspark Code](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/ai-developer): Get started with Genspark Code, an autonomous AI coding agent that plans, builds, tests, and deploys complete applications without you writing any code.
- [AI Meeting Notes](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/ai-meeting-notes): Learn how to use Genspark AI Meeting Notes. Record meetings on Apple Watch, iOS, Android, or Web, then get transcripts, summaries, and shareable notes.
- [AI Pods](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/ai-pods): Turn an article, video, or any topic into a podcast from a single prompt with Genspark AI Pods, then publish it or export an MP3.
- [Call For Me](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/call-for-me): Learn how to use Genspark Call For Me. Schedule or immediately place AI phone calls, then review the transcript and result summary afterwards.
- [Custom Agent](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/custom-super-agent): Build, manage, and share your own AI agent with Genspark Custom Agent — no coding needed. Create it from a single prompt, then reuse it anywhere by @mentioning it.
- [Hub](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/hub): Learn how to use Genspark Hub, a shared workspace that keeps files, context, and projects together. Add custom instructions and invite team members for easy collaboration.
- [Genspark Claw](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/genspark-claw): Learn how to set up and use Genspark Claw, your AI employee. Covers cloud and local modes, connected apps, skills, memory, and more.
- [Workflows](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/workflows): Learn how to automate your work with Genspark Workflows. Describe what you want in plain language, connect your email and calendar, then test and manage each run.
- [Chrome Extension](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/chrome-extension): Learn how to install and use the Genspark Chrome Extension, an AI sidebar that summarizes pages, analyzes data, and automates tasks in your browser.
- [GenTeam](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/genteam): Learn how to use GenTeam, Genspark's multi-agent workspace. Create AI agents as long-term teammates, chat with them in channels, and assign them work.
- [Realtime Voice](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/realtime-voice): Learn how to use Genspark Realtime Voice to talk to Super Agent hands-free. Launch background tasks by voice, track tasks, and switch seamlessly between voice and text input at any given moment.
- [Speakly](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/speakly): Learn how to set up and use Speakly, Genspark's AI voice input app supporting dictation in 100+ languages. Set shortcuts and custom modes.
- [GenTerminal](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/genterminal): Learn how to set up and use GenTerminal, Genspark's SSH terminal app for iPhone, Android, Mac, and Windows. Add hosts, sync across devices, and protect your keys with the vault.
- [AgentBase](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/agentbase): Learn how to use Genspark AgentBase: describe the system you need and AI builds the tables, dashboards, and views for you.
- [Genspark Design](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/genspark-design): Learn how to turn a prompt into prototypes, websites, posters, and more with Genspark Design. Refine everything on the Canvas, then ship runnable code with Build it.
- [Skills](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/skills): Learn how to use Genspark Skills — reusable AI tools that package an expert workflow into a single click. Browse 100+ community Skills, build your own, and share them with your team.
- [SecondBrain](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/secondbrain): Learn how to use Genspark SecondBrain, a personal knowledge and memory system. It connects your emails, meetings, files, and apps so Super Agent works with real context about you.
- [SecondBrain Note](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/secondbrain-note): Learn how to set up and use Genspark SecondBrain Note, the hardware device that captures, transcribes, and summarizes conversations into structured, searchable notes.
- [GenMail](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/genmail): Learn how to set up and use GenMail, Genspark's AI email and calendar client. Get inbox triage, AI-drafted replies, and one calendar across Gmail and Outlook.
- [GenClipboard](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/genclipboard): Learn how to set up and use GenClipboard, Genspark's free clipboard manager for Mac, Windows, and Linux. Search your history, paste with hotkeys, sync clips with end-to-end encryption, and more.
- [Salesforce Integration](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/salesforce-integration): Learn how to connect Salesforce to Genspark. Authorize once with OAuth, then query and update your CRM from Claw, Super Agent, and more.
- [Microsoft Office Plugin](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/microsoft-office-plugin): Learn how to install and use the Genspark add-ins for Microsoft Word, Excel, and PowerPoint — an AI task pane that drafts, analyzes data, and builds decks without leaving Office.
- [AI Drive](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/ai-drive): Learn how to use Genspark AI Drive to store, organize, preview, and share everything you produce on Genspark. Hand any file to Super Agent in one simple click.
- [Gen-1 Slides](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/gen-one-model): Learn about Gen-1, Genspark's first in-house model powering Standard mode in AI Slides at no extra cost.
- [Super App](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/super-app): Learn how to use the Genspark Super App, the desktop app for macOS, Windows, and Linux that combines Super Agent, GenMail, GenTeam, and GenCode in one window.
- [GenCode](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/gencode): Learn how to use GenCode, Genspark's coding agent capable of working from any directory you choose. Run it in the Super App or install the CLI.
- [AI Chat](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/ai-chat): Learn how to use Genspark AI Chat, a conversational AI agent that can answer questions, search the web, read your files, and more. Pick from 40+ models or the Mixture-of-Agents option for a mix of models optimized for your task.

## Account & Support

- [Account Management](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/account-management): Get help with your Genspark account, including login problems, password resets, and account security.
- [Membership Plans](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/membership-plans): A guide to Genspark's Free, Plus, and Pro plans. See what each tier includes and learn how to subscribe, change plans, and handle billing or refunds.
- [Team & Enterprise Plans](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/team-enterprise-plans): A guide to Genspark Team and Enterprise plans. Compare the two tiers and learn how to sign up, manage members, set up SSO, and more.
- [Credits Guide](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/credits-guide): A guide to Genspark credits: what they are, how to check your balance, and what makes one task cost more than another.
- [Common Issues](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/troubleshooting-guide): Solutions to common Genspark issues, from NSFW notices and failed generations to error codes like 400, 401, and 500.
- [Connectors & Integrations](https://www.genspark.ai/helpcenter/connectors-and-integrations): A guide to Genspark connectors. Connect the apps and services you already use, see what each one can do, and manage permissions, scopes, and connected accounts.
